+[28C[4A]0;⠂ Claude Code[28D[4B[5A[48;5;237m[38;5;239m❯ [38;5;231m# Reactive Spreadsheet Engine[39m                                                                                                                                                                                             [1B                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [1B  [38;5;231mBuild a spreadsheet engine as a TypeScript library. The engine manages a grid of cells that can contain values or formulas, with automatic reactive updates when dependencies change.[39m                                     [1B                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [1B  [38;5;231m## Cell References[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                        [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231mCells are referenced by column letter(s) followed by a row number: `A1`, `B2`, `Z100`, `AA1`, etc. Columns use letters A-Z, then AA-AZ, BA-BZ, etc. Rows are 1-based integers.[39m                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m## Cell Values[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231mA cell can contain:[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                       [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- **Numbers**: `42`, `3.14`[39m                                                                                                                                                                                               [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- **Strings**: `"hello"` (text values)[39m                                                                                                                                                                                    [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- **Booleans**: `true`, `false`[39m                                                                                                                                                                                           [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- **Formulas**: expressions starting with `=` (e.g., `=A1+B1`, `=SUM(A1:A5)`)[39m                                                                                                                                             [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m## Formulas[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                               [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231mFormulas begin with `=` and support:[39m                                                                                                                                                                                      [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- **Arithmetic operators**: `+`, `-`, `*`, `/`[39m                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- **Parentheses** for grouping: `=(A1+B1)*2`[39m                                                                                                                                                                              [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- **Cell references**: `=A1`, `=B2+C3`[39m                                                                                                                                                                                    [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- **Comparison operators**: `>`, `<`, `>=`, `<=`, `=`, `<>` (used in IF conditions)[39m                                                                                                                                       [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m## Built-in Functions[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                     [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- `SUM(range)` — sum of all numeric values in the range[39m                                                                                                                                                                   [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- `AVERAGE(range)` — arithmetic mean of numeric values in the range[39m                                                                                                                                                       [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- `MIN(range)` — smallest numeric value in the range[39m                                                                                                                                                                      [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- `MAX(range)` — largest numeric value in the range[39m                                                                                                                                                                       [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- `COUNT(range)` — count of numeric values in the range[39m                                                                                                                                                                   [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m- `IF(condition, trueValue, falseValue)` — conditional expression[39m                                                                                                                                                         [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m## Ranges[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                                 [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231mRanges are specified as `start:end`:[39m                                                                                                                                                                                      [49m
