+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231m## Reactive Updates[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                       [49m
+[48;5;237m                                                                                                                                                                                                                            [49m
+[48;5;237m  [38;5;231mWhen a cell's value changes, all cells that depend on it (directly or transitively) must automatically recompute. For example, if `B1` contains `=A1+1` and `A1` changes from `5` to `10`, then `B1` should automatically[39m [49m
